"""Full-JRL-price integrity guard. Source: Google Sheets "База РРЦ — Mark Shmidt & JRL" tab "База РРЦ", read 2026-10-23.
See https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1PkuleOknNhsvOX5Bmhp7ydjOnX05zuQESPcpibC-lXw/edit
Only the SKU list and a SHA-256 fingerprint are committed; price amounts remain in RRP_MAP_B64 secret.
Refresh the reference fingerprint after confirmed changes to the source spreadsheet.
"""
